<title>SWEDEN: Sweden FinMin can't exclude May 1 EMU announcement.</title>
<headline>Sweden FinMin can't exclude May 1 EMU announcement.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said on Tuesday he could not exclude the possibility that he might announce the government's view of Swedish participation in EMU at a speech on May 1.</p>
<p>&quot;I cannot say exactly when it will be made, but it's not far away,&quot; he told reporters.</p>
<p>The Swedish government has said it will announce its view on Swedish EMU participation by the end of May. -- Simon Haydon, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1004</p>
